{{> email_transactional_header}}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px; color:#172033; font-size:26px; line-height:34px;">Sign in to keep your account</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Your Free Quantified Self account has been inactive for more than six months. Your account and its associated activities, health data, settings, connections, and uploaded files are scheduled for permanent deletion after 30 days unless you sign in.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;"><a href="{{login_url}}" style="color:#174ea6; font-weight:700;">Sign in to keep my account</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Signing in during this window cancels the inactivity deletion. You do not need to buy a subscription. Automatic provider sync and requests from connected MCP clients do not reset the inactivity clock.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Basic and Pro memberships, including trials and gifted access, are protected while their access or subscription grace period remains active. Deletion runs periodically, so it may happen later than 30 days, but never earlier.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If you want to keep a separate copy of your data, sign in and export it. Account deletion cannot be undone in the app. If you need help, contact <a href="mailto:{{support_email}}" style="color:#174ea6;">{{support_email}}</a>.</p>
{{> email_transactional_footer}}
